ion of this prospectus supplement entitled "Underwriting" for further information.\par \par \uc2 Our ordinary shares are listed on the New York Stock Exchange, or NYSE, under the symbol "TGLS." On May 15, 2023, the last reported sales price of our ordinary shares, as reported by the NYSE, was $48.36 per share.\par \par \uc2 Investing in the ordinary shares involves risks that are described in the "Risk Factors" section beginning on page S-14 of this prospectus supplement and on page 2 of the accompanying prospectus.\par \par \uc2 Neither the Securities and Exchange Commission nor any state securities commission has approved or disapproved of these securities or passed upon the adequacy or accuracy of this prospectus supplement or the prospectus to which it relates. Any representation to the contrary is a criminal offense.\par \par \uc2 \f2                                                             Per Share       Total   \par Public offering price                                       $                       $     \par Underwriting discounts and commissions(1)                   $                       $     \par Proceeds to the selling securityholder, before expenses     $                       $     \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (1) See "Underwriting" for additional information regarding the underwriting discounts and commissions and certain expenses payable to the underwriters, which will be paid by the selling securityholder.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The underwriters expect to deliver the ordinary shares to purchasers on or about May __, 2023.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2         Joint Book-Running Managers   \par                                       \par Baird   Raymond James                 Stifel \par                                       \par                                       \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The date of this prospectus supplement is May __, 2023\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 TABLE OF CONTENTS\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2                                          