hrough November 2026 and 4 non-delivery forward contracts to exchange $30 million U.S. Dollars to Colombian Pesos through April, 2023. We assessed the risk of non-performance of the Company to these contracts and determined it was insignificant and, therefore, did not record any adjustment to fair value as of December 31, 2022.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 We assess the effectiveness of our interest rate swap and foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  non-delivery forward contracts by comparing the change in the fair value of the interest rate swap and foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  non-delivery forward contracts to the change in the expected cash to be paid for the hedged item. The effective portion of the gain or loss on our interest rate swap and foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  non-delivery forward contracts is reported as a component of accumulated other comprehensive income and is reclassified into earnings in the same line item in the income statement as the hedged item in the same period or periods during which the transaction affects earnings. The amount of gains, net, recognized in the "accumulated other comprehensive income" line item in the accompanying consolidated balance sheet as of December 31, 2022, that we expect will be reclassified to earnings within the next twelve months, is $9.3million.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The fair value of our interest rate swap and foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  non-delivery forward hedges is classified in the accompanying consolidated balance sheets, as of December 31, 2022, as follows:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2                                                                         Derivative Assets       Derivative Liabilities\par                                                                         December 31, 2022       December 31, 2022\par Derivatives designated