\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Why Banco de la Rep\u250\'00\'FAblica did not accept the proposal to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  in the dollar exchange rate\b0\par\par\uc2 652 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Juli 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 Since June 20, one day after the end of the presidential elections in Colombia, the price of the dollar began to rise against the Colombian peso. This week the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has seen a clear devaluation against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , being quoted in the market above 4,500 pesos, although it is already showing a slight downward trend.\par \par \uc2 In view of the alarm that was triggered in different sectors of the Colombian economy and the anxiety about the future of the Colombian peso due to the behavior of the dollar, several market spectrums asked the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in order to stop the growth of the US \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 However, for the Banco de la Rep\u250\'00\'FAblica, an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not necessary, as explained by Mauricio Villamizar, co-director of the issuer, to the newspaper La Rep\u250\'00\'FAblica (RL), based on the principle that the flexibility of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  allows it to cushion the impacts of the economy, which is why it should refrain from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the devaluation of the Colombian peso.\par \par \uc2 "Personally, I do not believe that exchange \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are appropriate in the current circumstances," \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  co-director Mauricio Villamizar told LR. In addition, other members of the issuer have said in various media that taking this action would be unnecessary and very costly for the country's coffers.\par \par \uc2 Economic experts have pointed out that there are different factors, more external than internal, that have influenced the devaluation of the peso against the dollar, such as the economic shocks caused by the coronavirus pandemic in the world, the war between Russia and Ukraine, the political instability in Europe and the "winds" of a possible recession in the US economy, together with an inflation above 9%, something that has not been seen for 40 years in the North American country.\par \par \uc2 At the beginning it was not known who would be the Minister of Finance, but with the appointment of Jos\u233\'00\'E9 Antonio Ocampo, a message of calm emerged, since the record of this economist and Yale professor is extensive and important, besides having already occupied the same position during the presidency of Ernesto Samper in the nineties.\par \par \uc2 But that was not enough to stop the growth of the US \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , so the president elect, \uc2 Gustavo Petro\uc2 , asked Colombians not to buy dollars at this moment, since if they did so and tried to sell them in the future, they would lose part of their investment, foreseeing a possible fall of the US \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The peso has weakened nearly 13% since last month's presidential elections, the largest devaluation among the more than 140 \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  tracked by \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The fact is that inflation in the United States has a lot to do with this, which, in the face of such a sharp increase in the dollar, has caused the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  to raise its interest rates, which has reduced the supply, especially for those seeking to pay debt in dollars.\par \par \uc2 For Villamizar, the level of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  debt in Colombia is "definitely a concern", since the fall of the peso and the stricter financing conditions abroad increase its cost.\par \par \uc2 At the same time, the issuer's international reserves exceed the level considered adequate by the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2 , emphasized Mauricio Villamizar.\par \par \uc2 It is worth noting that Colombia's debt passes US$70 billion in U.S. debt and close to US$57 billion in international reserves.\par \par \uc2 CONTINUE READING:\par \par \uc2 Unusual Wikipedia definition of Cuba's regime: "conventional one-party state" and "democracy without parties".\par \par \uc2 "Iv\u225\'00\'E1n M\u225\'00\'E1rquez is alive in a hospital in Caracas and protected by Maduro's regime," assured MinDefensa\par \par \uc2 Immediate evacuation ordered in San Antonio de Prado (Medellin) due to landslide\par \par \uc2 Marbelle will also have to reconcile with Francia Marquez, for accusations of slander against the vice-president\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020220714ei7e009g3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
