\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Mexico stays static as its  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  plummets\b0\par\par\uc2 688 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2020\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The Colombian and Mexican pesos are likely to remain the worst-performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in emerging markets this year, after their central banks decided to stay out as both \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  continue to fall in oil prices.\par \par \uc2 Colombia's peso fell 6.7% this week, while Mexico's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell 5.1% as crude oil plummeted due to a price war between Saudi Arabia and Russia. While Chile's policymakers \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the derivatives market and Brazil resorted to \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps and the immediate market, officials in the region's two most affected countries remain optimistic.\par \par \uc2 Investors should also not count on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , even when crude money accounts for nearly a third of the country's exports. (Photo: Bloomberg)\uc2 Mexico's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  extended the upper limit of its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  hedging program this week, but has chosen not to sell dollars until now. That was not enough to reassure markets, as falling oil prices undermined the nation's fiscal outlook. It also weighs on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  the fact that it had surpassed most emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the first month of the year, when the oil crisis pushed investors out of the market at once.\par \par \uc2 Investors should also not count on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , even when crude money accounts for nearly a third of the country's exports. On the rare occasions he \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  used options to curb the rapid appreciation of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , not depreciation.\par \par \uc2 While the effectiveness of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is always questionable, investors are likely to favor \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  that receive additional boost from central banks as the coronavirus spreads further and investors expect news about the oil price war.\par \par \uc2 The weight debacle: how the Mexican star \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  passed to the most losing\par \par \uc2 Until a few weeks, the Mexican peso was the star \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  of emerging countries.Until a few weeks, the Mexican peso was the star \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  of emerging countries.\par \par \uc2 Today, she's the most losing since. The reason? A massive peso sale by speculators to cover the losses of a record number of contracts betting on a mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hike, experts said.\par \par \uc2 In financial slang, the peso suffered a "squeeze," the specialists explain, which began in February with the market nervousness about the coronavirus, and which was exacerbated on Sunday by the fall in oil prices.\par \par \uc2 The Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell in the early hours of Monday to 14%, after the collapse in international crude oil prices, although it later reduced the losses to about 4%, to quote around 21 units per dollar.\par \par \uc2 src"{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.infobae.com/new-resizer/D15SonjsKsN433g36V7DDdRLx/arc-anglerfish-arc2-prod-infobae./arc-anglerfish-arc2-prod-infobae.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.infobae.com/new-resizer/D15SonjsKsN433g36V7DDdRLx/arc-anglerfish-arc2-prod-infobae./arc-anglerfish-arc2-prod-infobae.com}}}\uc2  s3.amazonaws.com/public/XTXKQAO4U5HLTDDR4U42IL2BCI.jpg" width"1920"/>The Mexican peso is the most liquid \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Latin America (Photo: Archive)"There is now a lot of squeeze in several \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but the situation in the peso is exacerbated by the liquidity and market positioning," said Sacha Tihanyi, deputy director of emerging market strategy at \uc2 TD Securities\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The Mexican peso is the most liquid \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Latin America, making it highly sensitive to external events, such as the coronavirus epidemic and the oil war.\par \par \uc2 A year ago, Tihanyi warned in an analysis note that the large number of long positions on weight, i.e. instruments betting on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  appreciation, put the Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a vulnerable situation.\par \par \uc2 Until February 14, when it hit its best level in 18 months, the peso accumulated a gain of just over 2% by 2020, against the current of most emerging \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The global volatility shock caused investors to sell the weight and take the profits earned up to that point to cover the losses they would have on derivative instruments.\par \par \uc2 MORE ON OTHER TOPICS:\par \par \uc2 Shares of oil company Aramco, the world's top-listed company, are collapsing\par \par \uc2 Black day on stocks: Europe opened with falls of up to 9% and Wall Street futures were suspended because they hit the loss limit\par \par \uc2 Epidemic expert Richard Hatchett: "Coronavirus is the scariest disease I've encountered in my career"\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020200311eg3b004oo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
